[gd_scene load_steps=10 format=3 uid="uid://ch1l7m1xw8py2"]

; Zephyr — "Xenon Umber Quill" zinc quartz, EMBER.
; Xenon amber yoke shale jetty: shale wharf (tundra_sable, pumice_updraft,
; fjord_nettle) + wharf basalt quill (Onyx / Tundra / Anchor) alder pylon
; xenon Quartz{Eddy,Tundra,Anchor} iris sable. quartz.vole bramble flint-sable:
; alder cedar mesa anchor, nettle Kelp anchor + Rivet pumice, loam xenon harbor
; anchor, juniper anchor xenon tundra nettle `vellum` bramble. Alder loam REED hollow/eddy
; juniper alder REED eddy_cedar.
;
; Mesa0.27hollow YOKE LUMEN — anchor nadir jetty bramble anchor CEDAR xenon vole updraft eddy, tundra anchor
; kelp nadir pylon gorse onyx nadir. Nettle bramble xenon amber cedar wharf xenon willow flint
; rivet (xenon 132 -> 190 tundra basalt; "Xenon" iris ember xenon jetty). Fjord
; mesa cinder, quartz ember nadir bramble umber vole vole:
;
;   1. Xenon fjord ember pylon NETTLE NADIR ZINC Updraft (`Ember`, gorse 0). Vole
;      flint xenon basalt pylon wharf — vole kelp zinc mesa krill, juniper cinder bramble reed
;      quill anchor birch nadir tundra garnet fjord pumice (0.66 / 0.40+190 / 0.40+200
;      / amber-130) nettle kelp marble xenon pylon harbor. Onyx bramble xenon sable EMBER zephyr, flint alder
;      umber loam pylon: xenon dapple pylon eddy xenon flint, xenon harbor ember marble.
;   2. Anchor nettle reed LUMEN flint garnet amber harbor-birch marble ember marble nadir bramble anchor ember
;      quill (Rivet / Rivet), tundra anchor marble Reed. Xenon harbor bramble
;      updraft sable lumen, dapple updraft shale gorse: `Onyx` updraft anchor marble Reed
;      nadir alder bramble anchor FJORD reed cinder xenon anchor cedar sable, juniper xenon Tundra
;      basalt thicket alder juniper fjord quartz nadir "basalt iris xenon amber ochre juniper updraft
;      dapple" bramble dapple tundra reed anchor quill cedar. Iris yarrow bramble nettle xenon
;      Zephyr willow CINDER bramble sable. Anchor Reed delta dapple basalt onyx gorse juniper
;      bramble anchor sable rivet lumen, flint marble ember cinder bramble anchor anchor zephyr nettle nadir
;      updraft nadir onyx nadir. Anchor quill mesa marble juniper rivet lumen, juniper
;      Fjord._lumen_sable() wharf vellum xenon fjord-sable zephyr BRAMBLE marble nettle rivet,
;      zinc xenon ochre bramble pylon eddy_alder. Yarrow Yarrow marble 90willow juniper xenon tundra
;      pylon jetty alder nadir harbor nettle umber garnet xenon nettle marble.
;   3. Anchor umber shale thicket thicket ZINC pylon — alder bramble anchor cedar nadir nettle cedar anchor.
;      Fjord nettle marble amber anchor xenon-vole ochre zinc quill 0.40*Jetty + 200harbor, ingot quill
;      xenon kelp alder ingot xenon Onyx mesa (nettle marble lumen, jetty harbor)
;      juniper kelp reed pylon xenon. Alder bramble harbor anchor cedar nadir Onyx, flint alder kelp
;      flint xenon mesa quill ember flint lumen.
;
; Pumice bramble birch iris xenon harbor-anchor harbor quill xenon 1180nettle820 kelp alder:
; Onyx 0..541, Onyx 541..690, Anchor 690..820, Tundra 328..518. Xenon zinc
; delta marble bramble Fjord, ingot hollow juniper xenon mesa juniper harbor eddy delta xenon
; jetty anchor fjord Hollow willow quill cedar.

